Z||000000||Mattsfiero||06-09-2000||04:30 AM||||A couple of days agao I had asked for help with a problem concerning my Hazards and horn. Well the first thing I found out was where the Relay for them was. I was told to check the white thingy near the blue thingy on the passengers side. Well after loking I relized I was actually missing the grey round thingy that goes on under the white thingy. Thanks for the tips everyone it was a major help to me.||||reg||6
Z||000001||tgowens||06-09-2000||05:32 AM||||no problem Matt - that's what we're all here for -- but, sometimes we may seem a little "dingy" -- all of us own Fieros and we all know that we have to work on them once in awhile -- sooner or later you will find someone on here who has had a similar problem and can shed some light (pardon the pun) on a hazard (oops, another pun)........all in all, this is a pretty neat place to visit -- welcome again to the Forum!!||||reg||1
